# Bookreader architecture

Web + API. Server owns books and reading progress. No auth in v1.

- Types: `Book`, `BookDetail`, `ReadingProgress`, `Chapter` in `packages/shared`
- Mutations: `Library` in `apps/api`. Missing ids throw `BookNotFoundError`
- EPUB parse only in `epub.ts`. Pages never unzip
- Progress is per `bookId`
- New page: `apps/web/src/pages/<Name>Page.tsx`
- Filters on `GET /books`, not only in the React list. Match title or parsed authors, case-insensitive. Do not LIKE the authors JSON column.
- Library search field has a visible label.
- Do not edit `scripts/check.sh`. Run it after edits
